  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Samanyika Kumboedza Paprika Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADF project will enable SKA to improve its financial management systems, build the business and leadership skills of the management and board, and improve the quality of paprika produced by farmer members. Additionally, SKA will operate a revolving inputs fund and facilitate the bulking and price negotiation with buyers on their members behalf.</narrative>
  </description>
